WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.688
The agenda matters more
than most people think,

2
00:00:02.688 --> 00:00:06.950
because it defines what the meeting
covers and tells everyone when it's over.

3
00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:09.912
When the agenda is done,
the meeting is done.

4
00:00:09.912 --> 00:00:12.211
A list of topic names can't do that job;

5
00:00:12.211 --> 00:00:16.350
a line that just says network tells
nobody what's expected of them.

6
00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:20.476
A real agenda writes each item
as a question or an outcome,

7
00:00:20.476 --> 00:00:24.514
says whether it's there to
inform, to discuss or to decide,

8
00:00:24.514 --> 00:00:27.938
and gives it an owner, a
time and any preparation.

9
00:00:27.938 --> 00:00:30.201
Which three pilot sites go first?

10
00:00:30.201 --> 00:00:33.162
focuses a room far
better than pilot sites.

11
00:00:33.162 --> 00:00:36.740
Around those items, a few more
details make the difference.
